# libs/typescript workspace (ADR-0024) — never commit build artifacts, coverage, deps.
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.svelte-kit/
*.tsbuildinfo
**/.tsbuildinfo
.nx/

# StrykerJS mutation lane (`ctl.sh mutate`) scratch — the per-lib temp dir + report (always removed
# on exit; ignored defensively so an interrupted run never stages scratch). The lane runs StrykerJS
# under the baked node (nvm); there is no committed patch/shim to exempt. The `stryker-setup-*.js`
# files are the vitest-runner per-worker setup files StrykerJS 9.x leaves in the project root under
# inPlace (stryker-js#5305) — the mutate verb reaps them; ignored so an interrupted run never stages.
**/.stryker-tmp/
**/stryker.log
**/reports/mutation/
**/stryker-setup-*.js

# The a11y-evidence Playwright lane (`ctl.sh a11y`) artifacts — the vite-built harness app + the
# Playwright run report. Regenerated on every run; never committed (the EVIDENCE is a11y-evidence/).
**/tests-a11y/dist/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
